{"id":"56ca5a602e3a1728","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top.md","title":"Sigma-1 Soundness and Decomposition of the Top","display":"thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top — Sigma-1 Soundness and Decomposition of the Top","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top","aliases":["67-thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top"],"display":"thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top — Sigma-1 Soundness and Decomposition of the Top","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"Corollary 7.1","source_printed_pages":[96],"source_pdf_pages":[107],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top — Sigma-1 Soundness and Decomposition of the Top"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Corollary 7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>107</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,&lt;_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,&lt;_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\">\\(\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>。基础理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 一致并具有固定 PR 公理呈示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\;(a_0&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_1&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_0\\vee_Ta_1=\\mathbf1_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\;(a_0&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_1&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_0\\vee_Ta_1=\\mathbf1_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\;(a_0&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_1&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_0\\wedge_Ta_1=\\mathbf0_T\\land a_0\\vee_Ta_1=\\mathbf1_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\;(a_0&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_1&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_0\\wedge_Ta_1=\\mathbf0_T\\land a_0\\vee_Ta_1=\\mathbf1_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项对应原书印刷96页/PDF107页 Corollary 1，包括括号内可同时令交为底的加强。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠，两个非顶度的有限一致性骨架都为真，骨架的合取仍一致，故并非顶。反向从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明的一个假 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句取其真的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 否定，利用引理5构造两句可分别与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 相容、析取在 PA 中可证且合取蕴含该真句的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句，得到交为底而并为顶。</p>\n<p>本次读了推论证明及引理5的自指构造，未将全书算术化与前章辅助引理独立重证；来源陈述核对与完整证明链核验仍分开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,<_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,<_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)$ 按 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]。基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 一致并具有固定 PR 公理呈示。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,<_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\;(a_0<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_1<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_0\\vee_Ta_1=\\mathbf1_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a_0,a_1\\in D_T\\;(a_0<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_1<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land a_0\\wedge_Ta_1=\\mathbf0_T\\land a_0\\vee_Ta_1=\\mathbf1_T).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false}],"bytes":2281,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-degree-sigma1-sound-top]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b","4ff6c9f71377d6d7","b0667bf165ad62df"]}